<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!--
  Entitlements for the codesigned .app bundle.

  Intentionally empty. We don't use `NetworkExtension` — the project
  exists *because* Microsoft's NEDNSSettings.matchDomains path is broken
  in their own client. We wrap the openvpn binary, which talks to utun
  through a PF_SYSTEM socket; that doesn't require any NEKit
  entitlement.

  Codesigning still requires this file present so the build profile is
  reproducible; add entries here only when a future signed-and-notarized
  release needs them.
-->
